  <div class="eyebrow">The Author</div>
  <h2 class="author-name">Gaurav Srivastava</h2>
  <p class="lead">Gaurav Srivastava has spent close to two decades in the technology industry. Along the way he built his own consultancy and sold it to a larger firm.</p>
  <p>Today he works hands-on with AI, using it to write software and automate real-world problems in his day-to-day work, and he remains genuinely amazed by how much is suddenly possible.</p>
  <p><em>Selective Ambition</em> grew out of that abundance: the realisation that when you can build almost anything, the hardest and most valuable skill becomes choosing what <em>not</em> to.</p>
